# Files executed inside Linux containers must keep LF line endings even on a Windows checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.tpl text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
# Part 32: CTD's signed file and public key must stay byte-for-byte (the signature covers the exact bytes).
backend/app/platform/licence/ctd_config.json binary
backend/app/platform/licence/ctd_config.json.sig binary
backend/app/platform/licence/ctd_public_key.pem binary
